Dear @michaelo,@petersellis,@singhai,@Safety 

Once again, a large number of active, policy-compliant Iranian accounts on X have been hit by coordinated mass reporting and subsequently suspended.

These users have been consistently posting within the platform’s rules, mainly amplifying the real voices of the Iranian people and their legitimate opposition to the current regime. Their activity has remained peaceful and in full compliance with X’s policies.

We respectfully ask you to personally review the histories of these accounts. It will become clear that no rules have been violated and that these suspensions appear to be the result of organized mass reporting aimed at silencing Iranian voices.

This pattern has repeated multiple times. We kindly request a fair and thorough investigation, along with the reinstatement of accounts that have always followed the rules.

